OL,3,A'You're going to win the war': Harry
OL,4,Apraises war veterans on surprise
OL,5,AUkraine visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke of Sussex has received an
OL,8,Fenthusiastic welcome in a surprise
OL,9,Fvisit to Ukraine to support injured war
OL,10,Fveterans, meeting Ukrainian competitors
OL,11,Ftaking part in his Invictus Games.
OL,13,FThere were emotional scenes as he was
OL,14,Fapplauded by injured service men and
OL,15,Fwomen in Lviv, where he told his
OL,16,Faudience: "You're going to win the
OL,17,Fwar."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
