OL,3,A'You're going to win the war': Harry
OL,4,Apraises war veterans on surprise
OL,5,AUkraine visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrince Harry spent two days at events
OL,8,Ffor veterans, with a press blackout for
OL,9,Fsecurity reasons until he had left
OL,10,FUkraine, as the country continues to
OL,11,Fface missile attacks from Russia.
OL,13,FUkraine has more than 150,000 injured
OL,14,Fwar veterans and the prince visited
OL,15,Fprojects supporting their treatment and
OL,16,Frehabilitation.
